#x02009;mm; 15&#x02009;mm)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;Bone</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">1 (100&#x02009;mm)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">&#x02014;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;Kidney</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">1 (30&#x02009;mm)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">1 (35&#x02009;mm)</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="t1-fn1"><label/><p>Numbers without parentheses correspond to number of patients. Numbers in parentheses correspond to lesion diameters, or diameter ranges with mean diameters.</p></fn><fn id="t1-fn2"><label/><p>Lesion size is defined by largest axis diameter.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="tbl2" position="float"><label>Table 2</label><caption><p content-type="table-title">Distribution of CNB results in 112 patients with suspected lymphoma</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups" border="1" width="85%"><colgroup><col align="left"/><col align="char" char="."/></colgroup><tbody valign="top"><tr><td colspan="2" align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><italic>Lymphoma with complete subtyping/grading (54)</italic></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;DLBCL activated type</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">13</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;DLBCL germinal centre type</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">8</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;MCL</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">3</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;Anaplastic large cell lymphoma</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">3</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;Nodular sclerosis classical HL</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">4</td></tr><tr